 Account sign-in&lt;br&gt;Google 2-Step Verification&lt;br&gt;Chrome + Drive for desktop/browser&lt;br&gt;Office where licensed&lt;br&gt;Offline GCPW validity tested&lt;br&gt;Local work continues during some cloud outages&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="85" y="510" width="575" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="left-2-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="85" y="800" width="575" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="left-2-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;LAN and peripherals&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Router/firewall supplies DHCP&lt;br&gt;DNS forwarding + guest Wi-Fi isolation&lt;br&gt;Outbound cloud access only&lt;br&gt;No inbound Internet RDP&lt;br&gt;Replace AD DNS/DHCP/file/print dependencies&lt;br&gt;Document rollback and outage behavior&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="85" y="800" width="575" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="left-3-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="85" y="1090" width="575" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="left-3-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Optional mobility&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Approved remote location/device&lt;br&gt;Same Google identity + 2SV&lt;br&gt;Managed device or controlled BYOD&lt;br&gt;No direct RDP/SMB; separate approval&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="85" y="1090" width="575" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-0-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="220" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-0-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Google Workspace identity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Authoritative user directory&lt;br&gt;Users, groups and organizational units&lt;br&gt;2-Step Verification / FIDO2&lt;br&gt;Context-aware access where licensed&lt;br&gt;Password, recovery and offboarding&lt;br&gt;Audit and investigation logs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="220" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-1-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="220" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-1-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;GCPW and Windows / management&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Allowed domains + first-sign-in enrollment&lt;br&gt;Windows device management&lt;br&gt;Supported settings + OMA-URI&lt;br&gt;MSI/XML app deployment&lt;br&gt;Inventory + device actions&lt;br&gt;No third-party MDM conflict&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="220" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-2-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="510" width="414" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-2-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Policy and control gaps&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Pilot → Standard organizational units&lt;br&gt;GCPW offline validity + account rules&lt;br&gt;Browser, firewall and security settings&lt;br&gt;Feature gaps require separate controls&lt;br&gt;Do not assume Intune parity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="510" width="414" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-3-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="510" width="414" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-3-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Additional endpoint controls&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;AV/EDR if required&lt;br&gt;BitLocker recovery&lt;br&gt;Local-admin and password rotation&lt;br&gt;Patching/RMM if required&lt;br&gt;Validate ownership and support model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="510" width="414" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-4-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="850" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-4-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Backup and recovery&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Independent Google Workspace backup&lt;br&gt;Endpoint/local-data backup if needed&lt;br&gt;Sample restore testing&lt;br&gt;Documented rebuild and exit process&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="850" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-5-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="850" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="middle-5-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Network and retirement&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Cloud DNS/DHCP or router&lt;br&gt;Certificates, VPN and RADIUS remediated&lt;br&gt;AD dependency inventory&lt;br&gt;AD DS decommission gate&lt;br&gt;No permanent domain controller&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="850" width="414" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="right-0-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c25b06;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1805" y="220" width="507" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="right-0-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;color:#17395f;&quot;&gt;Google Workspace services&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#25364d;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;Gmail, Drive, Docs and shared drives&lt;br&gt;Native Google sign-in and SSO&lt;br&gt;Shared-drive ownership and permissions&lt;br&gt;Google-native collaboration&lt;br&gt;Company-owned data and accounts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1805" y="220" width="507" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="right-1-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c25b06;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1805" y="510" width="507" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="right-1-text" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-